UnitPaymentHubTransition
├── when a transition is requested
│   ├── given the stored status equals the from status and the edge is in the table
│   │   └── it writes the status and emits exactly one StatusChanged
│   ├── given the stored status differs from the from status
│   │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidTransition and emits nothing
│   └── given the edge is not in the table
│       └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidTransition
└── when an unknown payment is read
    └── it reads as None
